# Firmware Development

This folder contains the embedded firmware developed for the CAN-Based Network Traffic Management System.

## Development Platform
- TI C2000 Microcontroller
- Embedded C
- Code Composer Studio (CCS)

## Firmware Modules

### 1. CAN Communication
- CAN message transmission and reception
- CAN frame identification
- Message ID and data handling

### 2. Traffic Monitoring
- Real-time CAN bus monitoring
- Bus utilization calculation
- Message arrival frequency monitoring
- Queue length and waiting time analysis

### 3. Adaptive Scheduling
- Message priority evaluation
- Deadline monitoring
- Congestion-aware scheduling
- Adaptive transmission management

### 4. Communication Verification
- Transmission completion monitoring
- Independent CAN reception verification
- Message ID and data comparison
- PASS/FAIL validation

## Programming Language
Embedded C
